# slider-focus (h8-points-slider): Tab x5 from the body reaches the track
# (measured on ref-h8 WebKit: 4 function radios, then the slider). The 3 px
# primary-32% ring shows with the tip. Behaviour: activeElement is the slider.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
key Tab
wait 200
shot slider-focus
